# Raw per-run CASSCF logs from the (closed) QN/BFGS variant experiment --
# ~210 MB, far too much for the repo and regenerable from the drivers here.
#
# Nothing in the conclusions depends on having them: the numbers they
# support are tabulated in RESUME.md and written up in cpp_casscf/README.md
# ("The QN/BFGS convergence-variant experiment: a negative result"). If you
# do regenerate them, tabulate_mgh_det.py turns them back into the results
# table, and the per-log counters it greps for are listed in RESUME.md.
mgh_det_logs/

# Same, for the two archived sub-experiments. Their README.md /
# orbguess_findings.md write-ups and the small trace_*.txt evidence files
# are tracked -- only the multi-MB run logs are dropped.
superseded_v6_or_semantics/*.log
orbguess_run/*.log
